WEBVTT

00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:15,600
Also, the health world is saying you should use talo as your fat instead of seed oils,

00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:22,080
but would this be harmful for someone who has had breast cancer because it involves animal proteins?

00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:30,800
No, I would not say it's harmful. There's more and more information coming out of the inflammatory

00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:42,240
effects of seed oils, and you could say that systemic inflammation is at least a piece of all cancers,

00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:54,480
it's a piece of all diseases, probably. And you could make a valid argument that when our society

00:00:54,480 --> 00:01:05,920
in general was using lard and talo as their fat source in society, there were no seed oils,

00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:15,280
so we're only using butter and talo and lard in cooking. There really was no cancer. There was

00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:22,160
very little heart disease, but heart disease and cancer, the two number one killers of the people

00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:30,080
in the Western world has skyrocketed since the use of seed oils. Now, you could argue that,

00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:35,120
oh, well, there's other things that are involved with that. Yes, I would agree, toxic levels, etc.

00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:45,840
However, I think that using talo, which is the beef equivalent of lard, lard is made from pork fat,

00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:58,800
talo is made from beef fat, would be much healthier for you in cooking than using seed oils.

